tests/cassettes/
  Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2025): scene metadata (identifiers, acquisition times, cloud
  cover, platform and footprints of Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 scenes), retrieved on 2026-10-26 from the
  Earth Search STAC API by Element 84 (https://earth-search.aws.element84.com/v1) and trimmed to the fields
  used in the tests. Copernicus Sentinel data are provided free of charge under the Copernicus data policy.
